<item>
            <title>[MAHOUT-685] Make the maven release process work for 0.5</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-685</link>
                <project id="12310751" key="MAHOUT">Mahout</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This is a bit of an omnibus to keep track of sorting out release problems.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The first one is that the release profile suppresses tests, so the test jar doesn&apos;t get built, so the build fails.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
