                            <comment id="13026983" author="hudson" created="Fri, 29 Apr 2011 14:19:03 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Integrated in Mahout-Quality #784 (See &lt;a href=&quot;https://builds.apache.org/hudson/job/Mahout-Quality/784/&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://builds.apache.org/hudson/job/Mahout-Quality/784/&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;br/&gt;
    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-685&quot; title=&quot;Make the maven release process work for 0.5&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;MAHOUT-685&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;MAHOUT-685&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;: use weaker test skipping in the release process.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="13029746" author="srowen" created="Fri, 6 May 2011 04:47:32 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;This is the last issue for 0.5. Is it actually resolved, meaning, any known issues here that would preclude starting the release process?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="13029759" author="tdunning" created="Fri, 6 May 2011 05:27:11 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Looks to me like it is reasonable to start practicing.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="13029947" author="srowen" created="Fri, 6 May 2011 14:20:35 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Let&apos;s reopen if we find other issues during the release process. But resolving for now in the absence of any known issues.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
